/* Hand-placed skeletons for id's monster drawings (gore, PLAN-skin-suit.md
   2.2): where the fitter (scene3d/skeleton_fit.cpp) gets a drawing wrong, its
   joints placed by eye with tests/skeleton_tool.py, which writes this table.
   Each entry is keyed to the original artwork as death_rigs_stock.h is: the
   lump's name, its size and an FNV-1a hash of its decoded index and coverage
   pairs, so replaced art (a PWAD, Freedoom) falls back to the fitter. Joints
   in scene3d's SkeletonJoint order (pelvis, neck, head, shoulders, elbows,
   hands, hips, knees, ankles; each pair the body's right first), in units
   right of the drawing's origin as stored (unmirrored) and above its feet. */
